{"type":"step-attempt","step":"design","sessionId":"ecd9eb06-eb74-4599-8d6b-b1ecb38ec921","outcome":{"verdict":"success","findingsPath":null,"error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"reason":"Wrote design.md, spec.md, tasks.md under specrunner/changes/lockfile-sync-verification-gate/ on branch change/lockfile-sync-verification-gate-9ed51f1b.\n\nPlan summary — lockfile 整合 gate を verification に追加:\n- New module src/core/verification/lockfile-sync.ts: pure evaluator evaluateLockfileSync (decision table) + orchestrator runLockfileSyncGate. diff 形状検査（依存関連7セクションの canonical deep 比較）で偽陽性を回避。\n- 既存 seam 再利用: detect-pm に findLockfile/isLockfileName（additive, detectPackageManager 無改変）、changed-lines に getChangedFileList（name-only, getChangedFilesAndLines 無改変）、base 版は git show <base>:<path>。新規 runtime 依存なし。\n- runner 両経路（commands/phases）の changed-line-coverage と同型の後段に配線。baseBranch presence でガードし既存 verification テストを無改変保全（tampered 早期 return / .some・env アサートに非依存であることを実確認済み）。\n- 決定表: 依存変更あり+lockfile非含+追跡あり→failed(<pm> install 案内)、+lockfile含→passed、依存変更なし/非追跡/diff unavailable→skipped+明示 note（silent pass にしない、fail-closed にしない）。\n- implementer user message 両分岐（testsMaterialized true/false）に lockfile 同期指示（prompt×gate 二層）。\n- タスク T-01..T-07、各 Acceptance に #935 歯・両経路・workspace 検出・偽陽性回避・prompt 指示・既存テスト無改変 green を割付。","status":"success"},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-01T10:01:26.269Z","endedAt":"2026-08-01T10:15:05.212Z","commitOid":"13f0b827934d55539284be24a8f318398079ebba"}
